stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED : Sample Uploaded
    QUEUED --> STATIC_ANALYSIS : Worker Picks Up Task
    STATIC_ANALYSIS --> DYNAMIC_ANALYSIS : Static Features Extracted
    DYNAMIC_ANALYSIS --> FEATURE_EXTRACTION : Dynamic Telemetry Processed
    FEATURE_EXTRACTION --> ML_INFERENCE : Features & Sequences Encoded
    ML_INFERENCE --> REPORT_GENERATION : Ensemble & XAI Computed
    REPORT_GENERATION --> COMPLETED : Report Saved to MongoDB

    QUEUED --> FAILED : Execution Exception / Timeout
    STATIC_ANALYSIS --> FAILED : Parse / Format Error
    DYNAMIC_ANALYSIS --> FAILED : Sandbox / Normalization Error
    FEATURE_EXTRACTION --> FAILED : Feature Extraction Error
    ML_INFERENCE --> FAILED : Model Inference Error
    REPORT_GENERATION --> FAILED : Database Persist Error
